{"version":2,"exportedAt":1770076872940,"story":{"title":"Sir Reginald's Big Dance","userPrompt":"Knight and dancing","authorStyleId":"sandra-boynton","readingLevel":"early","illustrationStyleId":"cartoon_comic","pages":[{"pageNumber":1,"text":"Sir Reg was a knight. He was brave and quite strong. But Reg had a secret. He loved to dance all day long!","illustrationPrompt":"A round, friendly pig knight, Sir Reg, in shiny armor. He has a goofy grin and one hoof tapping the ground. Background: a green field with a bright blue sky. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1767987792844,"durationMs":5384,"retries":0,"promptLength":975,"success":true,"prompt":"cartoon style, comic book illustration, bold outlines, expressive characters, vibrant colors, dynamic poses, child-friendly A 8-year-old boy with pale freckled skin, with short sandy blonde hair in slightly messy, choppy bangs, big-expressive bright blue eyes with happy expression, wearing A child-sized knight costume. A bright blue tunic with a yellow lion emblem, silver leggings, and brown leather boots that are slightly too big. A toy silver helmet sits slightly askew on his head., with toy silver helmet, a sprinkling of freckles across his nose, a missing front tooth, creating a gap-toothed smile, a small bandage on his left knee, bright red cheeks from exertion. Sir Reginald is standing in a grassy meadow near a castle, but instead of holding a sword and shield, he is posed as if dancing. He has a joyful expression. in A grassy meadow near a castle. The castle should be visible in the background.. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":2,"text":"His sword? A soft pillow. His shield? A big drum. He'd prance and he'd twirl, 'til the whole day was done.","illustrationPrompt":"Sir Reg holding a fluffy pillow like a sword and a drum like a shield. He's doing a silly dance move. Background: a castle made of bouncy balls. Colors: bright pinks, yellows, and blues. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1767987793639,"durationMs":6179,"retries":0,"promptLength":919,"success":true,"prompt":"cartoon style, comic book illustration, bold outlines, expressive characters, vibrant colors, dynamic poses, child-friendly A 8-year-old boy with pale freckled skin, with short sandy blonde hair in slightly messy, choppy bangs, big-expressive bright blue eyes with joyful expression, wearing A child-sized knight costume. A bright blue tunic with a yellow lion emblem, silver leggings, and brown leather boots that are slightly too big. A toy silver helmet sits slightly askew on his head., with toy silver helmet, a sprinkling of freckles across his nose, a missing front tooth, creating a gap-toothed smile, a small bandage on his left knee, bright red cheeks from exertion. Sir Reginald is dancing in the meadow. Instead of a sword, he's holding a soft pillow. Instead of a shield, he's holding a big drum. He's twirling. in A grassy meadow near a castle.. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":3,"text":"One day, a big dragon flew down from the sky. Sir Reg felt a fright. He started to cry.","illustrationPrompt":"A small, cartoonish dragon with big, googly eyes looking down at Sir Reg. Sir Reg looks surprised and a bit scared, with a tear rolling down his cheek. Background: a bright orange and yellow sunset. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1767987792813,"durationMs":5353,"retries":0,"promptLength":1227,"success":true,"prompt":"cartoon style, comic book illustration, bold outlines, expressive characters, vibrant colors, dynamic poses, child-friendly A 8-year-old boy with pale freckled skin, with short sandy blonde hair in slightly messy, choppy bangs, big-expressive bright blue eyes with fri